{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Default Stonekeep PII classification rules. Patterns are regular expressions matched against the NORMALIZED field name (snake_case, lowercase, diacritics folded: `phoneNumber` -> `phone_number`, `imię` -> `imie`, `straße` -> `strasse`). Classification is heuristic and is a starting point for a human review, not a legal determination.",
